{
  "id": "师旷",
  "name": "师旷",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "person",
  "typeConfidence": "medium",
  "description": null,
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "chuci-13-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "照兮,\n\n抚招摇以质正。\n\n立师旷俾端词兮,\n\n命咎繇使并听。\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-02-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "未于百步之外，不能见渊中之鱼；师旷之聪，合八风之调，而不能听十里"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-07-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "昔者师旷奏白雪之音，而神物为之下降，风"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-10-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "理，天下无虐刑，有贵于言者也；师旷瞽而为太宰，晋无乱政，有贵于见"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-13-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "醎酸而已矣。晋平公出言而不当，师旷举琴而撞之，跌衽宫壁，左右欲涂"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-15-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "世，此皆因时变而制礼乐者。譬犹师旷之施瑟柱也，所推移上下者，无寸"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 22,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-22-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n\n昔晋平公令官为钟，钟成而示师旷，师旷曰：“钟音不调。”平公曰"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 23,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-23-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "智也。六律具存，而莫能听者，无师旷之耳也。故法虽在，必待圣而后治"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "chuci",
    "chapterIndex": 13
  }
}
